  "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&bull; Brand introduction:</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Welcome to D.Design Fashion, a brand of elegance and style rooted in the heart of the United States. Our brand is a blend of Southern charm, bohemian vibes, and European inspired styles, catering to a large community of women seeking unique styles outside of big box fashion brands.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Crafted by women for women, our brand encapsulates the essence of femininity, empowerment, and individuality. Our dedicated team, deep in the fashion industry since 2009, had a longstanding dream of curating a unique brand. Now, we're thrilled to share our expertise with you, presenting an array of high-quality styles that resonate with your diverse tastes.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-9719f8a8-7fff-c6cf-a9ba-ea845206f47f\"><span>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Quality Meets Affordability. Crafted by team of fashion industry experts, D.Design Fashion brings quality style directly to our customers. </span><span><br></span><span><br></span><span>&bull; Payment terms: All types (ex. credit/debit card, Paypal, Bank Deposit, Buy Now Pay Later with Shop Pay)</span><span><br></span><span><br></span><span>&bull; Other information: Contact ddesignfashionus@gmail.com for any questions or assistance.</span></b></p>",
